Package: basemapper
Title: Headless Spatial Basemap Renderer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pukar", "Bhandari", email = "arpuuuk@gmail.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders MapLibre GL styled basemaps (vector and raster tiles)
    headlessly with a Rust core: a software port of MapLibre GL JS's
    renderer, tested pixel by pixel against MapLibre GL JS. Renders at any
    fractional zoom and pixel ratio to PNG, rasters and arrays, or to true
    vector SVG; several styles can be stacked. Integrates with ggplot2 via
    geom_basemap() and with tmap v4 via tm_basemap(), rendering at the
    output device's resolution.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
